# THE `AVRA_*` READS NO DECLARATION HOLDS, each with its reason (tools/settings_reads.py).
# One a line: the source, the variable, why it is no setting of the compiler's.
packages/cli/src/commands/disk_host.av AVRA_LIGHT a shim word: the shim asks a run to do no heavy work, set by it and read by it alone
packages/std-ui/src/realize/dom/live.av AVRA_EXACT a library read in a built program, never the compiler's
packages/std-ui_http/src/document.av AVRA_PAGE_MODULE what `avra dev` hands the page program it runs
packages/std-ui_http/src/document.av AVRA_PAGE_HOST what `avra dev` hands the page program it runs
packages/std-ui_http/src/document.av AVRA_PAGE_FETCHED what `avra dev` hands the page program it runs
packages/std-avrac/src/compiler/tests/externs/externs.av AVRA_NO_SUCH_VARIABLE_ a fixture: a name nothing sets, read through the host row
packages/std-io/src/tests/io/io.av AVRA_IO_CORPUS_UNSET a fixture: a name nothing sets
packages/std-io/src/tests/io_adversarial_test.av AVRA_IO_SURELY_UNSET_ a fixture: a name nothing sets
packages/std-io/src/tests/io_test.av AVRA_IO_NO_SUCH_VARIABLE a fixture: a name nothing sets
packages/std-http/src/tests/http_stream_download/http_stream_download.av AVRA_STREAM_PIECES a program test's own size, set by the run that sizes it
packages/std-http/src/tests/http_stream_upload/http_stream_upload.av AVRA_STREAM_PIECES a program test's own size, set by the run that sizes it
runtime/tests/cores_test.c AVRA_FLOW_TRACE a runtime test reading back the variable it set for its child
runtime/tests/tasks_door_test.c AVRA_TASKS_DIR a runtime test reading back the variable it set for its child
runtime/tests/tasks_door_test.c AVRA_TASKS_DIR_NEXT a runtime test's own hand-off between its phases
